@startuml
title Selected MVP - idempotent atomic settlement
start
:Authenticated user selects group, payee,\namount, currency and payment date;
:Send payment command and idempotency key;
:Resolve debtor from session; validate required fields,\npositive exact-scale amount and distinct parties;
if (Valid?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Return actionable error;
  stop
endif
:Begin transaction; lock group ledger row;
:Recheck current membership or own historical\nsettlement entitlement for this debtor and payee;
if (Authorized?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Roll back; deny without disclosing private due;
  stop
endif
if (Command key already committed?) then (yes)
  if (Digest matches?) then (yes)
    :End transaction; return prior authorized result;
  else (no)
    :Roll back; return key conflict;
  endif
  stop
endif
:Read current committed positive pairwise netDue\nfor this group and currency under lock;
if (Positive due and amount no greater than due?) then (yes)
  :Save payment, negative journal settlement,\nhistorical entitlements and command receipt;
  if (All writes commit together?) then (yes)
    :Release lock; return recorded payment result;
  else (no)
    :Roll back all effects; return failure or retryable conflict;
    stop
  endif
else (no)
  :Roll back; reject and show current amount owed;
  stop
endif
:Reauthorize balance query; read committed journal snapshot;
:Show current group/currency pairwise debt;
note right
  Report expense lists use expenseDate;
  payment lists use paymentDate.
  Period balances use postedAt with labeled
  opening, movement and closing amounts.
  No bank transfer is executed.
end note
stop
@enduml
